{"id":"f7efc342a84d366e","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-interpolant.md","title":"Interpolant","display":"df-interpolant — Interpolant","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-interpolant","aliases":["93-df-interpolant"],"display":"df-interpolant — Interpolant","depends_on":["[[93-df-formula]]","[[93-df-consequence]]","[[93-df-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-interpolant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-interpolant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-interpolant — Interpolant"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"afd7605d365be7b6\" href=\"?note=afd7605d365be7b6\" title=\"93-df-consequence\">93-df-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> is a logic-pair candidate, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> is its connective-type candidate, and its consequence relation is bound in the assertion.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}\\)</span> is the sourced type-indexed finitary structural-logic predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\">\\(\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(-;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\">\\(\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(-;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\)</span> are the indexed formula carrier and recursive variable-support function of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}\\)</span> is the interpolant predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interpolant}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\nF=\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in F\n\\land\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\theta\n\\land\\{\\theta\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\psi\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\theta;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\varphi;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\cap\n\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\psi;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interpolant}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\nF=\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in F\n\\land\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\theta\n\\land\\{\\theta\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\psi\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\theta;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\varphi;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\cap\n\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\psi;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The logic and its connective type are explicit parameters. Thus neither the consequence relation nor the substitution signature can change with an ambient context.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"afd7605d365be7b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})$ and $\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(-;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})$ are the indexed formula carrier and recursive variable-support function of [[93-df-formula]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(-;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interpolant}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\Bigl[{}&\nF=\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L})\\\\\n&\\land\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in F\n\\land\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\theta\n\\land\\{\\theta\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\psi\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\theta;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\varphi;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\cap\n\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\psi;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1686,"backlinks":[{"id":"eda3df85f724c1ae","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})$ is the type-indexed predicate of [[93-df-interpolant]]."},{"id":"af4bf41c645962b1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})$ is the sourced type-indexed interpolant predicate of [[93-df-interpolant]]."}],"outgoing":["c2ca1af9af149e69","afd7605d365be7b6","bd7e4207897c8db3"]}